WEBVTT

00:13.150 --> 00:19.660
<i>A Hero. A bringer of peace
who battles monsters and protects people.</i>

00:20.700 --> 00:23.410
<i>The young boy, Dai,
was raised by monsters.</i>

00:23.580 --> 00:28.290
<i>He decided to fight the Dark Army
after being trained by the Hero, Avan.</i>

00:29.920 --> 00:35.510
<i>Traveling with Popp, the Mage, they were
later joined by Maam, a Warrior Priest.</i>

00:36.390 --> 00:42.560
<i>Monsters of the Dark Lord Hadlar's Six
Legions attacked these Disciples of Avan.</i>

00:43.810 --> 00:46.980
<i>They defeated Crocodine
of the Furfang Legion,</i>

00:47.480 --> 00:50.270
<i>and were victorious against
Hyunckel of the Undead Legion.</i>

00:53.490 --> 00:55.780
<i>Dai continues on the path of a Hero.</i>

00:56.780 --> 01:01.410
<i>His next adversary is
Blizzblaze General Flazzard.</i>

01:04.080 --> 01:08.830
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.080 --> 01:08.830
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.000 --> 01:13.260
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.000 --> 01:13.260
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.420 --> 01:17.050
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:13.420 --> 01:17.050
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:25.890 --> 01:29.230
<i>Since when was it?</i>

01:25.890 --> 01:29.230
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

01:29.400 --> 01:32.150
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

01:29.400 --> 01:32.150
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

01:32.320 --> 01:34.690
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

01:32.320 --> 01:34.690
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

01:34.860 --> 01:37.990
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

01:34.860 --> 01:37.990
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

01:38.160 --> 01:42.370
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

01:38.160 --> 01:42.370
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

01:43.660 --> 01:47.870
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

01:43.660 --> 01:47.870
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

01:48.040 --> 01:52.210
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

01:48.040 --> 01:52.210
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

01:52.380 --> 01:57.590
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

01:52.380 --> 01:57.590
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:57.760 --> 02:02.550
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:57.760 --> 02:02.550
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

02:02.720 --> 02:06.770
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

02:02.720 --> 02:06.770
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

02:06.930 --> 02:10.770
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

02:06.930 --> 02:10.770
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

02:10.940 --> 02:15.860
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

02:10.940 --> 02:15.860
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

02:16.030 --> 02:20.820
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

02:16.030 --> 02:20.820
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

02:20.990 --> 02:24.580
<i>And dream my dream</i>

02:20.990 --> 02:24.580
<i>yume wo miru</i>

02:24.740 --> 02:26.910
<i>And know my dream</i>

02:24.740 --> 02:26.910
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

02:35.250 --> 02:43.600
BLIZZBLAZE GENERAL FLAZZARD

03:01.360 --> 03:04.410
What's wrong, Maam? You seem blue.

03:05.370 --> 03:07.290
I'm fine.

03:08.120 --> 03:10.460
I was just thinking.

03:12.460 --> 03:14.380
About Hyunckel?

03:16.000 --> 03:16.800
Yeah.

03:17.550 --> 03:21.550
Did you, well, like...

03:21.720 --> 03:23.180
Did you like him?

03:23.340 --> 03:23.840
Huh?!

03:26.140 --> 03:27.140
I don't know.

03:27.930 --> 03:34.060
But, when I looked into his sad eyes,
I wanted to help him.

03:34.480 --> 03:36.150
I wanted to be by his side.

03:36.730 --> 03:38.230
I just got that feeling.

03:38.650 --> 03:42.700
Don't worry! It's okay. He's not dead.

03:42.860 --> 03:48.410
After all Dai and I threw at him,
he was fit as a fiddle, remember?

03:48.540 --> 03:49.450
Popp?

03:49.620 --> 03:53.620
He was even Undead Legion Commander.
He wouldn't die so easily.

03:54.040 --> 03:56.920
You're right. Thank you, Popp.

03:57.090 --> 03:58.500
Uh, sure.

03:58.920 --> 04:03.300
He must be alive.
He was a Disciple of Avan, after all.

04:03.680 --> 04:06.140
<i>Oh man! What the hell am I doing?!</i>

04:06.300 --> 04:09.470
<i>Here I am, talking up my rival
for some reason!</i>

04:10.430 --> 04:12.020
Ow!

04:12.850 --> 04:14.100
Finished!

04:16.480 --> 04:19.900
Wow, it's like new! Amazing!

04:21.030 --> 04:25.200
They used to call me
the Papnica Inventor King!

04:25.570 --> 04:29.540
What happened to being
"the greatest swordsman in Papnica"?

04:29.990 --> 04:33.870
Now we're all set! Let's go rescue Leona!

04:34.040 --> 04:37.790
The problem is just where is the Princess?

04:38.170 --> 04:40.630
He's right. She's missing, isn't she?

04:40.800 --> 04:44.300
Where to look
in this vast continent of Holkia?

04:44.470 --> 04:46.800
I guess we'll have to take it slowly.

04:46.970 --> 04:52.100
But if we don't hurry, the next Legion
Commander of the Dark Army might show up.

04:52.270 --> 04:53.560
Leona...

04:53.730 --> 04:55.940
That's it!

04:56.100 --> 04:57.730
What's it, old timer?

04:57.900 --> 05:00.730
The temple! We should go to the temple!

05:01.320 --> 05:02.610
The temple?

05:05.820 --> 05:09.830
Hey, old timer,
what's in this ruined temple?

05:09.990 --> 05:15.460
The temple has a basement warehouse.
Try to find the entrance.

05:16.250 --> 05:17.880
This won't be easy.

05:18.540 --> 05:21.130
What's in that warehouse?

05:21.300 --> 05:22.800
Signal flares!

05:23.800 --> 05:25.130
Signal flares?

05:25.880 --> 05:32.310
Papnica has flares that use
gunpowder to send signals during battle.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.100
Huh. With gunpowder?

05:34.270 --> 05:40.810
If we find and launch one, the Princess
is sure to see it wherever she is.

05:41.230 --> 05:42.320
I see.

05:42.480 --> 05:45.490
If we launch
a red signal flare of victory,

05:45.650 --> 05:49.780
I'm sure the Her Majesty will feel
it's safe enough to show up.

05:49.950 --> 05:51.030
Found it!

05:53.290 --> 05:56.660
Ooh! This might actually be it!

05:57.540 --> 05:58.790
It's no good!

05:59.750 --> 06:01.130
We can't get in.

06:01.290 --> 06:06.300
But... I don't think we can move all this.

06:07.550 --> 06:10.470
Leave it to me! Everybody get back!

06:14.310 --> 06:16.810
He seems excited.

06:16.980 --> 06:19.810
He probably can't wait
to test his strength.

06:20.310 --> 06:24.900
Since I told him he beat Hyunckel
without the power of his mark.

06:25.690 --> 06:29.910
<i>Let's test out whether I can
use that skill or not!</i>

06:32.030 --> 06:33.200
Frizz!

06:36.450 --> 06:38.460
You moron! Don't!

06:39.920 --> 06:42.290
Fire Earth Slash!

06:51.640 --> 06:54.470
Yes! I really did it!

06:55.060 --> 06:58.770
You moron! Of all the attacks to use!

06:58.930 --> 07:01.940
There's gunpowder down there! Gunpowder!

07:05.190 --> 07:06.570
Oh crap!

07:06.730 --> 07:08.820
They've ignited! Run!

07:34.850 --> 07:39.520
A total loss.
All the signal flares were blown away.

07:40.100 --> 07:45.860
Hey dummy, why couldn't you use Crack
for an Ice Earth Slash or something?

07:46.020 --> 07:46.690
Hmm?

07:46.860 --> 07:47.730
Sorry.

07:47.900 --> 07:51.860
Well, at least the flares were launched.

07:52.030 --> 07:55.410
Don't you think Princess Leona
got the message?

07:55.570 --> 08:02.410
I dunno. With that crazy display, she
might get suspicious and stay hidden.

08:03.750 --> 08:04.630
Sorry.

08:06.670 --> 08:07.710
Huh?

08:09.510 --> 08:10.550
What's that?

08:10.710 --> 08:11.510
Huh?

08:13.550 --> 08:15.390
It's not a bird.

08:15.550 --> 08:16.350
Is it a monster?!

08:16.510 --> 08:17.850
No, that's...!

08:19.600 --> 08:21.850
That's...

08:22.020 --> 08:23.940
The Papnica Balloon Ship!

08:24.100 --> 08:25.150
Balloon Ship?

08:25.310 --> 08:29.860
It's a vehicle that travels by air!
The royal family uses it!

08:30.030 --> 08:31.070
What?!

08:34.570 --> 08:35.450
Take us down.

08:37.870 --> 08:39.370
That's Baduck!

08:39.540 --> 08:41.700
Hey! Hey!

08:42.200 --> 08:43.410
Hey!

08:43.580 --> 08:44.500
Wow.

08:44.670 --> 08:46.210
That's impressive.

08:46.580 --> 08:48.040
Hey!

08:51.130 --> 08:52.590
Hey!

09:01.430 --> 09:02.730
Lady Amy!

09:02.890 --> 09:06.850
Baduck, did you send up those flares?

09:07.440 --> 09:11.440
You know her, old timer?
Introduce me, will you?

09:11.980 --> 09:13.690
Fool! Show some respect!

09:14.400 --> 09:18.530
This is Lady Amy,
one of the Papnica Troika!

09:18.990 --> 09:23.120
A woman that young? I was thinking...

09:23.290 --> 09:25.910
We're the Papnica Troika!

09:26.670 --> 09:30.840
Those strange flares went up,
so we came to check it out.

09:31.090 --> 09:33.880
I left the Princess with Apollo and Marin.

09:34.050 --> 09:39.220
By Princess, you mean Leona, right?!
Is she okay?! Where is she?!

09:39.390 --> 09:40.510
Who are you?

09:40.680 --> 09:45.140
I'm a friend of Leona's! My name is Dai!

09:45.310 --> 09:47.190
Dai? You're Dai?!

09:47.350 --> 09:52.900
That's right. This young man is
the Hero Her Majesty always talks about.

09:53.070 --> 09:59.370
This young man and his friends
have already vanquished the Undead Legion.

09:59.530 --> 10:01.330
You can all rest easy.

10:01.660 --> 10:02.530
What?!

10:02.700 --> 10:04.660
Vanquished the Undead Legion?!

10:04.830 --> 10:07.920
Are you really Dai, the Hero?

10:15.130 --> 10:18.680
This is a weapon
of the Papnica royal family!

10:20.090 --> 10:24.100
Leona gave it to me. It's my treasure!

10:26.810 --> 10:28.980
I understand. Come with us.

10:29.140 --> 10:31.310
The Princess waits at Valge Island.

10:31.480 --> 10:35.030
Valge Island?! The Princess is there?!

10:42.070 --> 10:43.080
Wow!

10:43.240 --> 10:44.620
Holy cow!

10:45.160 --> 10:46.660
This thing is amazing!

10:48.040 --> 10:52.580
Of course.
It's the only Balloon Ship in Papnica.

10:52.750 --> 10:55.500
Man, what a surprise.

10:55.670 --> 11:01.550
When you came from the sky,
I thought you were the Princess, Miss Amy.

11:01.720 --> 11:07.810
Oh no. The Princess is far more beautiful
than I could ever hope to be.

11:07.980 --> 11:11.310
Ooh. I can't wait to meet her!

11:12.020 --> 11:14.230
Gross. You're such a creep.

11:14.400 --> 11:18.440
Oh come on! This is a princess
we're talking about here.

11:18.610 --> 11:20.400
Who wouldn't be interested?

11:20.570 --> 11:24.530
I bet she's gentle and cute,
unlike someone I know.

11:24.700 --> 11:25.950
What?

11:26.120 --> 11:29.660
Leona's cute, but she's not really gentle.

11:29.830 --> 11:31.420
Huh? R-Really?

11:31.580 --> 11:36.920
She's brutally honest.
She could be worse than Maam.

11:37.090 --> 11:40.510
If she's worse than Maam,
is she really okay?

11:41.220 --> 11:42.930
What's that supposed to mean?

11:43.090 --> 11:46.180
If she's worse than Maam,
she must be an ogre.

11:48.930 --> 11:50.060
Why you...!

11:50.230 --> 11:53.230
Hey! Behave yourselves!

11:56.070 --> 11:58.610
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

12:01.030 --> 12:03.610
HELL'S CLAW

12:08.450 --> 12:10.040
There's the island!

12:20.710 --> 12:23.130
So that's Valge Island?!

12:23.300 --> 12:24.970
The sea is spinning!

12:26.100 --> 12:27.890
That's the Valge Whirlpool.

12:28.810 --> 12:33.100
Because of that,
most people avoid Valge Island.

12:33.520 --> 12:39.150
To get there by boat requires taking a
long route to avoid the whirlpool.

12:39.480 --> 12:43.610
Plus Valge Tower
is the only thing on that island.

12:43.950 --> 12:47.370
I never would have guessed
Her Majesty was there.

12:47.530 --> 12:49.870
It's all thanks to this Balloon Ship.

12:50.410 --> 12:56.330
We used it as a message ship while we
planned for a counterattack at the tower.

12:56.750 --> 12:59.710
That must be the tower
in the middle of the island.

13:00.920 --> 13:04.430
It used to be used as a lighthouse.

13:04.590 --> 13:06.430
That's where Leona is!

13:07.220 --> 13:11.270
<i>At last... At long last I can see Leona!</i>

13:11.680 --> 13:13.430
Let go, you bastard!

13:13.600 --> 13:15.230
Shut up! It's mine!

13:15.390 --> 13:16.560
It's mine!

13:16.730 --> 13:18.020
That's enough!

13:18.190 --> 13:19.400
It's mine!

13:19.570 --> 13:21.280
What is it?! What is going on?!

13:21.440 --> 13:23.530
Sir Apollo! Lady Marin!

13:23.690 --> 13:26.320
They're fighting over rations!

13:26.490 --> 13:27.780
Over rations?

13:30.030 --> 13:32.330
That's enough!
You're embarrassing yourselves!

13:32.790 --> 13:36.670
It's his fault!
He tried to take more than his share!

13:36.830 --> 13:41.300
I've been on guard for three days!
I deserve to eat this much!

13:41.460 --> 13:44.010
I haven't eaten anything in a whole day!

13:44.170 --> 13:46.010
Shut up! Let go!

13:46.180 --> 13:47.470
You let go!

13:47.630 --> 13:48.720
Hand that over!

13:50.260 --> 13:51.470
Princess!

13:51.640 --> 13:52.930
Your Majesty?!

14:02.190 --> 14:03.780
What are you doing?!

14:03.940 --> 14:04.690
Throwing it away!

14:04.860 --> 14:05.820
What?!

14:05.990 --> 14:08.610
But it's the last of our valuable food!

14:08.780 --> 14:13.160
Valuable or not,
if it sparks conflict, I don't want it.

14:14.500 --> 14:15.620
All of you...

14:16.040 --> 14:20.880
The reason we're in hiding
and preparing for a counterattack...

14:21.290 --> 14:24.130
is to thwart the Dark Army's evil.

14:24.670 --> 14:30.220
How can we fight amongst ourselves
over our own greed?!

14:31.300 --> 14:33.890
That's no different from the Dark Army!

14:34.390 --> 14:40.480
If the alternative is to live as monsters,
then let us starve to death as a humans!

14:42.060 --> 14:43.400
I'm so ashamed.

14:44.150 --> 14:47.610
You've barely eaten, too, Princess.

14:47.780 --> 14:51.070
And here we are, the first to complain.

14:51.780 --> 14:53.200
Forgive us!

14:53.580 --> 14:55.160
We're sorry.

14:57.910 --> 14:59.210
Have you calmed down?

14:59.370 --> 15:00.250
Yes!

15:00.580 --> 15:03.250
Then talk it over and share.

15:03.420 --> 15:04.550
Very well!

15:10.510 --> 15:14.350
We just need to hold out a little longer!

15:15.010 --> 15:17.770
I know the Hero will come to save us!

15:18.390 --> 15:21.230
You mean the young man
you always speak of?

15:21.400 --> 15:23.020
I believe his name is Dai?

15:23.190 --> 15:24.190
Right!

15:24.360 --> 15:29.320
He's a little short,
but he's got the Hero spirit.

15:29.490 --> 15:33.990
I sent him a tutor,
so he should have gotten stronger by now.

15:34.160 --> 15:38.040
That's not a very nice way
to speak of our savior.

15:40.960 --> 15:45.540
But do think such a boy will really come?

15:45.710 --> 15:47.000
Let us believe he will.

15:48.010 --> 15:51.220
At the very least, the Princess believes.

15:51.800 --> 15:55.390
If the Princess believes,
then so should we all.

15:55.550 --> 15:58.810
<i>Sorry, but that's
a pipe dream right there.</i>

15:58.970 --> 16:01.980
<i>The Hero and company
are at the bottom of a pool of lava.</i>

16:02.140 --> 16:02.730
Who's there?!

16:04.400 --> 16:08.780
<i>Such leadership and charisma
for a little girl.</i>

16:08.940 --> 16:12.860
<i>I may have scored
a bigger fish than I thought.</i>

16:14.030 --> 16:14.780
Over there!

16:15.280 --> 16:17.080
You! Who are you?!

16:17.490 --> 16:20.410
Blizzblaze General Flazzard.

16:20.580 --> 16:24.830
Sorry I ain't your Hero, little Princess!

16:27.540 --> 16:28.340
The Dark Army!

16:28.500 --> 16:29.460
Curse you!

16:34.800 --> 16:37.890
One was burned and one was frozen...

16:38.850 --> 16:43.100
He can control both heat and cold?

16:43.520 --> 16:45.520
Time to die now.

16:46.400 --> 16:50.190
Today the Papnica royal family dies out!

16:50.360 --> 16:51.530
Don't be ridiculous!

16:51.690 --> 16:54.530
We won't let you lay a finger
on the Princess!

16:54.700 --> 16:56.200
Die, monster!

16:58.620 --> 17:00.120
We can stand this flame!

17:01.370 --> 17:05.290
Too hot for you?
Then let me cool you down!

17:16.430 --> 17:17.300
With one blow?!

17:18.800 --> 17:20.100
The temperature difference.

17:20.260 --> 17:24.810
The rapid temperature difference of
the flames and ice weakened their armour!

17:24.980 --> 17:26.350
Hmm?

17:26.520 --> 17:30.150
Looks like we got at least one guy
with some brains.

17:30.320 --> 17:33.940
I am Apollo of the Papnica Troika!

17:34.110 --> 17:36.110
And I am Marin!

17:36.950 --> 17:39.910
We shall protect the Princess
with our lives!

17:40.080 --> 17:42.200
Ooh. Good for you.

17:42.370 --> 17:46.870
Marin, hit his flame side
with a Crack spell.

17:47.040 --> 17:48.710
I shall hit the other side.

17:48.880 --> 17:49.880
Got it!

17:50.040 --> 17:52.170
Here goes! Kafrizz!

17:53.960 --> 17:54.720
Kacrack!

17:58.050 --> 17:59.090
Whoops!

18:02.430 --> 18:07.100
Goodie, goodie.
Giving me a feast as a welcome?

18:10.980 --> 18:15.280
Stop! He's absorbing the spell energy!

18:18.490 --> 18:19.870
Right back at you.

18:23.660 --> 18:24.750
Insulate!

18:27.500 --> 18:29.080
Insulate, huh?

18:29.250 --> 18:33.420
Well, well. I guess that "Troika" title
ain't just for show.

18:34.000 --> 18:39.130
Now matter how strong your flames or ice,
you cannot pierce this defensive shield!

18:39.470 --> 18:42.760
Okay, okay, I get it.

18:42.930 --> 18:49.400
Then out of respect for your performance,
let me show you a neat trick.

18:49.560 --> 18:50.770
A trick?!

18:51.230 --> 18:52.400
K...

18:53.570 --> 18:54.900
a...

18:55.990 --> 18:57.280
fr...

18:58.530 --> 18:59.820
i...

19:01.160 --> 19:01.950
zz!

19:06.040 --> 19:09.120
Five Finger Flares!

19:20.970 --> 19:23.600
Look! Something's wrong down there!

19:24.010 --> 19:26.180
Could the Princess be in danger?!

19:32.980 --> 19:36.480
<i>He fired five Kafrizz spells at once.</i>

19:37.230 --> 19:39.650
<i>He's an unbelievable monster!</i>

19:41.160 --> 19:43.700
Apollo, let me heal you!

19:52.210 --> 19:55.590
Y-You bastard!
How could you do that to Marin?!

19:56.170 --> 19:57.800
Don't make me laugh!

19:57.960 --> 20:02.380
This is a battlefield!
It doesn't matter who you are!

20:02.680 --> 20:06.720
The strong live and the weak die!

20:09.140 --> 20:13.350
If you don't want to get hurt,
stay off of the battlefield!

20:13.770 --> 20:17.190
Ain't that right, Princess Leona?

20:17.860 --> 20:23.160
You're prepared to die
in any horrible way, aren't you?

20:26.990 --> 20:29.160
Hurry! Get us down there!

20:29.500 --> 20:30.950
Can you land on the roof?!

20:31.120 --> 20:32.210
Yes, my lady!

20:32.710 --> 20:34.080
<i>Leona...</i>

20:35.250 --> 20:36.460
Crack!

20:41.720 --> 20:44.010
So much for Papnica.

20:44.430 --> 20:48.720
When the survivors hear of your death,
they'll all lose hope.

20:48.890 --> 20:53.810
I'm sure they'll never think of
opposing the Dark Army again.

20:54.190 --> 20:58.820
Don't assume humans are like you monsters!

20:59.150 --> 21:00.440
What was that?

21:00.860 --> 21:05.200
There will always be someone
who'll stand against you!

21:05.740 --> 21:08.780
So long as humanity has its pride!

21:09.660 --> 21:14.500
That's some courage there.
Right when you're about to die!

21:14.670 --> 21:20.250
Bye-bye, little Princess.
Go act tough on your way to the afterlife!

21:25.050 --> 21:27.340
<i>Wait... that knife...</i>

21:27.680 --> 21:28.470
Who's there?!

21:31.470 --> 21:32.640
Dai?!

21:33.060 --> 21:35.230
You?! You're alive?!

21:35.600 --> 21:36.940
Get away from Leona!

21:38.730 --> 21:40.150
Save it for someone who cares!

21:45.110 --> 21:49.410
If you even touch Leona, you'll regret it!

21:50.200 --> 21:51.490
Dai!

21:53.370 --> 21:55.500
You little brat!

22:20.230 --> 22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.230 --> 22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.150 --> 22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.150 --> 22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.160 --> 22:36.210
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.160 --> 22:36.210
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.500 --> 22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.500 --> 22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:46.720
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.880 --> 22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.880 --> 22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.310 --> 22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.310 --> 22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.690 --> 23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.690 --> 23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.900 --> 23:08.200
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.900 --> 23:08.200
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.360 --> 23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.360 --> 23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.200 --> 23:19.330
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.200 --> 23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.390 --> 23:38.350
<i>Dai battles Blizzblaze General Flazzard.</i>

23:38.520 --> 23:42.440
<i>Flazzard uses the Blizzblaze Legion's
unbeatable strategy.</i>

23:42.600 --> 23:48.030
<i>With Flazzard's obsession with winning at
any cost, Dai and friends fall into peril.</i>

23:48.190 --> 23:52.570
<i>What's worse, Leona falls prey
to Flazzard's cruel intentions.</i>

23:53.320 --> 23:55.660
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:55.830 --> 23:57.620
<i>"The Terrifying Curse Field"</i>

23:57.790 --> 23:59.710
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:59.710 --> 24:01.710


24:01.710 --> 24:03.700

